          "text": "**Evaluating failure risks**\n\nI'm considering the risk of failure in this scenario. The original design lacks a rolling-resistance mechanism, which could impact performance. A ball that settles into pure rolling can maintain a speed above 5 cm/s, so I wouldn\u2019t mark it down just yet. Honestly, I think it\u2019s not observed as a failure. I need to focus on how the setup works under different conditions, especially with regards to friction. Let\u2019s refine this further!",
